      "reverse": true,
      "dim": "need_for_cognition"
    },
    {
      "code": "IPIP_NFC10_08",
      "zh": "我会尽量避开复杂的人。",
      "en": "Try to avoid complex people.",
      "reverse": true,
      "dim": "need_for_cognition"
    },
    {
      "code": "IPIP_NFC10_09",
      "zh": "我会避开难懂的阅读材料。",
